### 트래커 install 포스트백 — :name은 appsflyer | airbridge | adjust | adbrix-remaster
# 아래는 appsflyer 파라미터 예시 (트래커별로 쿼리 키가 다름)
GET {{host}}/appsflyer/install?clickid=click-0001&af_siteid=site-1&af_c_id=CAMPAIGN_TOKEN&advertising_id=38400000-8cf0-11bd-b23e-10b96e40000d&device_ip=1.2.3.4&country_code=KR&click_time=2026-07-22T10:00:00Z&install_time=2026-07-22T10:05:00Z

### 트래커 event 포스트백 (appsflyer 예시)
GET {{host}}/appsflyer/event?clickid=click-0001&af_siteid=site-1&af_c_id=CAMPAIGN_TOKEN&advertising_id=38400000-8cf0-11bd-b23e-10b96e40000d&device_ip=1.2.3.4&country_code=KR&install_time=2026-07-22T10:05:00Z&event_time=2026-07-22T11:00:00Z&event_name=af_purchase&event_revenue=1000&event_revenue_currency=KRW

### adjust install 포스트백 예시
GET {{host}}/adjust/install?clickid=click-0002&af_siteid=site-1&af_c_id=CAMPAIGN_TOKEN

### airbridge install 포스트백 예시
GET {{host}}/airbridge/install?clickid=click-0003&af_siteid=site-1&af_c_id=CAMPAIGN_TOKEN

### adbrix-remaster install 포스트백 예시
GET {{host}}/adbrix-remaster/install?clickid=click-0004&af_siteid=site-1&af_c_id=CAMPAIGN_TOKEN

### install 포스트백 로그 — token 기준
GET {{host}}/postbacks/install?token=CAMPAIGN_TOKEN&start_date=2026-07-01&end_date=2026-07-22

### install 포스트백 로그 — view_code 기준(일자별 상세 화면)
GET {{host}}/postbacks/install?view_code=VIEW_CODE&start_date=2026-07-01&end_date=2026-07-22

### event 포스트백 로그 — admin 이벤트명을 campaign_config로 변환해 조회
GET {{host}}/postbacks/event?token=CAMPAIGN_TOKEN&event_name=purchase&start_date=2026-07-01&end_date=2026-07-22

### 미등록 이벤트 카운트 — campaign_config에 없는 이벤트명 그룹 합계
GET {{host}}/postbacks/unregistered?token=CAMPAIGN_TOKEN&start_date=2026-07-01&end_date=2026-07-22
